":\"lume daemon-triad\",\"title\":\"Always-On P2P Sub-100ms Swarm Gossip Sentinel across Primary PC + Dell G3 + Acer\"},{\"id\":2,\"command\":\"lume hot-evolve\",\"title\":\"Zero-Downtime Autonomous Self-Recompilation & Atomic Binary Hot-Swap across all Triad nodes\"},{\"id\":3,\"command\":\"lume live-cockpit\",\"title\":\"Real-Time Continuous Voice + Screen Vision + Network Telemetry Interactive Loop\"}],\"autonomous_conjecture\":\"" + sn_jesc(s.auto_conjecture) + "\",\"capsule_cid\":\"" + s.capsule_cid + "\"}"

